    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Isle of Any is a boutique New York ideas company founded in 2023 by Laurie Howell and Toby Treyer-Evans, both ex-Droga5 Executive Creative Directors with 15 years at that agency prior. Before Droga5, they were at Wieden + Kennedy London and JWT. They trained originally as industrial designers. The studio is small (2 founders, likely a handful of collaborators) but punches well above its size: best-known work includes OpenAI/ChatGPT's first-ever brand campaign (2025, warmth-led film, shot on 35mm, NFL Primetime debut) and the Coinbase Oscars ad 'Your Way Out' (2026, live-action NPC/video-game aesthetic, 136M views, 43% sales uplift). Also worked with The New York Times, A24. Won Ad Age Campaign of the Year and Craft of the Year 2026. Autonomy 5: fully independent founder-led studio, no parent, they set their own creative direction entirely.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-06-28T23:16:36",
      "set_by": "agent"
